{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#540","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#540","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#540\",\"parent_revision\":\"698fd9baf68b36b97ee12892e63e0d33813e977a\",\"root_revision\":\"27c67e826345dfb543034e9d153b84578ae4095047e91df86938c0ddc8d01ba0\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Chore\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nInterview the user with 5 mission statement questions to draft and refine `plugins/plugin-creator/mission.json`.\\n\\nRun: `/plugin-creator:mission-statement plugins/plugin-creator --interview`\\n\\n**Q1 \u2014 Non-Negotiable:** \\\"What is the one thing this plugin must never sacrifice, even to ship faster?\\\"\\n**Q2 \u2014 Bad Twin:** \\\"What would a superficially similar but wrong version of this plugin do? What makes it wrong?\\\"\\n**Q3 \u2014 Trade-offs:** \\\"When forced to choose between breadth vs depth / correctness vs speed / explicit vs implicit \u2014 which does this plugin choose, and why?\\\"\\n**Q4 \u2014 Removal Trigger:** \\\"What would make you remove this plugin from the marketplace entirely?\\\"\\n**Q5 \u2014 Anti-Pattern Example:** \\\"Give me a specific example of a fix or improvement this plugin should refuse to make, even if asked.\\\"\\n\\nAfter interview: update `mission.json` with answers, set `interview_backlog_item` to this issue number, validate with 3 known past decisions.\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAssessment date: 2026-04-23\\n\\n| # | Condition | Status | Source |\\n|---|-----------|--------|--------|\\n| 1 | User available to answer Q1\u2013Q5 interactively | MISSING | Requires live session with user |\\n| 2 | `plugins/plugin-creator/mission.json` exists or can be created | AVAILABLE | Plugin directory present in repo |\\n| 3 | `/plugin-creator:mission-statement` skill available | AVAILABLE | Plugin-creator plugin installed |\\n\\nVerdict: BLOCKED \u2014 user must conduct the interview interactively; Q1\u2013Q5 answers are MISSING.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **mission interview: plugin-creator** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Mission statement development process\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-07\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\nP2 Chore. Affects only `plugins/plugin-creator/mission.json`. No code changes. Zero risk.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Mission interview conducted interactively with the user answering all 5 questions\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/mission.json` updated with Q1\u2013Q5 answers\\n- `interview_backlog_item` field in mission.json set to `#540`\\n- 3 known past decisions validated against the resulting mission statement\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `plugins/plugin-creator/mission.json` \u2014 created/updated with interview answers\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs a plugin maintainer, I need to conduct the 5-question mission interview for plugin-creator so the plugin has a documented, validated mission.json that guides future decisions.\\n\",\"digest\":\"bf503a49940c90eb76c438d367c34d2d9a2b07e6c0e431f848253eef1e8f2c4b\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgzjbw\"}"}